{%- comment -%}
  Customer reviews carousel: white cards with rating, title, review, name, "Verified Customer" and two tags. Desktop (768px and up): 3 cards per page. Phones: 1 card per page. Arrows, dots and finger swipe.
  EDIT YOUR REVIEWS BELOW. One review = rating ||| title ||| review text ||| name ||| photo link ||| tags
  The tags are separated by a single |  (for example: Stable Sugar | Steady Energy). Leave the photo link empty for a grey person icon. Put @@ on its own line between reviews.
  The photo links start as Metabolae's own files so the section is an exact copy straight away. Before you go live, upload your own customer photos (Content > Files), paste your links here, and replace the review texts with real reviews from your own customers.
  mb_per_page = cards per page on desktop. mb_accent = stars, Verified Customer, tags and the active dot (Metabolae's orange; use #943434 for your red). mb_tag_bg = the tag background (the accent colour with 12% opacity: #c472451f for orange, #9434341f for #943434). mb_text_color = rating, title and review. mb_name_color = the name. mb_bg = section background.
  These colours are locked, so the theme cannot turn them black.
  Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; instead. Do not type three | in a row except as the separators.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mb_per_page = 3 -%}
{%- assign mb_accent = '#c47245' -%}
{%- assign mb_tag_bg = '#c472451f' -%}
{%- assign mb_text_color = '#000000' -%}
{%- assign mb_name_color = '#6e6e6e' -%}
{%- assign mb_bg = '#faf5f2' -%}
{%- capture mb_reviews -%}
